stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: create (server row + IP reserved in one transaction)
    pending --> running: infra says running, started_at = clock
    pending --> failed: infra says stopped/deleted,<br/>or never ready after N passes<br/>(IPs released, delete sent to infra)
    pending --> terminating: terminate requested
    running --> terminating: terminate requested<br/>ended_at = clock, IPs released
    running --> terminated: drift check: gone from the infra
    terminating --> terminated: infra says deleted or unknown
    terminated --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
